{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:317d0b2e8525ef040731b22e07fac5215012f704e9b7bff2fadef8c0f083f3ce",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d1ff69c4fd2530c040007adf6f46e83b1f63836cd999c301f7de9ab788940e9",
      "text": "为了热情地嗨起来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc0934a176974a2a960c7cc09d18eeb4da8a02423547d939dcf4d75cd3c7f9bb",
      "text": "呜哦哦哦哦……！再多来点！\n快浮现出来吧，能让粉丝彻底燃起来的点子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:337b0c79dadc61b5a44dbff5821f7823490e3c451be500cc8d5e9b90c821c525",
      "text": "不过真荣幸啊。能把带动现场气氛的方案，\n拿来跟我们商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0193723fc1ea6bb94e52396b118bae6569426078df2e404fd80fa35b2008f86",
      "text": "噢！隼人先生他们这么信赖咱们，\n绝对不能辜负他们的期待啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9eb4feeac14a6870be49357f4baa60da399bed130fa24e76724ed4ea0f61f9a3",
      "text": "对了！如果要搞呼喊应答的话，\n用容易喊出口的词汇不是挺好的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ea15b5635b192fe0426a70fb076273f3553c541185b478d1b2f52e90661255f",
      "text": "确实听起来不错。\n用谁都能参与、简单明了的词如何。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a6a61d7c48846e952dcf586ef8920e2dcc28e25661567d971cb71e1fa035e2b",
      "text": "那样也更容易产生一体感吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e21359d2be22d2c05d941129c9dccfbcb505b9b2851737e6c5f98e06e566b5e5",
      "text": "哦哦，这主意太棒了！这样肯定能把气氛\n彻底带热起来啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0a070df38d6023073420848ff1cad16f1413c2d772f5ea6061385479874a1c4",
      "text": "不过，这首歌是要由315 Pro全员演唱的。\n还是融入更多样化的元素比较好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6033a6bb8018c4695b76a2da915b1a8aa264a54a321730a0c0079189f20a9374",
      "text": "那样的话啊，去找彩的各位商量商量怎么样？\n刚才看他们为了开会来事务所了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_003_22_5_06_003_22:5_06_003_22:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d88dfb4d6543785df12f5f291ecae57f86e42294a0f900f267015e47f661580",
      "text": "众力功成。那三位的话，应该能想出\n与我们视角不同的好点子。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
